<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <!-- Makes the website work properly on phones/tablets -->
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Just The Guy Gutters & Exteriors | Mid-Michigan</title>

    <meta
        name="description"
        content="Just The Guy Gutters & Exteriors provides seamless gutters, gutter guards, gutter repairs and exterior services throughout Mid-Michigan."
    >

    <style>
        /* =========================================================
           JUST THE GUY GUTTERS & EXTERIORS
           Main Website Styles
           ========================================================= */

        :root {
            --blue: #1762B5;
            --dark-blue: #06285C;
            --green: #2C9622;
            --light-green: #EAF6E8;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --light-gray: #F5F7F9;
            --gray: #64748B;
            --dark: #172033;
            --border: #DDE3EA;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: var(--dark);
            background: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        button,
        input,
        textarea {
            font: inherit;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1150px, 92%);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           HEADER
           ========================================================= */

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.97);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .navbar {
            min-height: 78px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .logo-mark {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .logo-text {
            line-height: 1.05;
        }

        .logo-text strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .logo-text span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--green);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .nav-button {
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 19px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .nav-button:hover {
            color: white;
            background: #237a1b;
        }

        .mobile-menu {
            display: none;
            font-size: 28px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           HERO
           ========================================================= */

        .hero {
            min-height: 650px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    rgba(4, 36, 84, 0.82),
                    rgba(4, 36, 84, 0.72)
                ),
                url("images/hero.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-text {
            color: white;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #B9E9B2;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 70px);
            line-height: 1.02;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 19px;
            max-width: 600px;
            color: #E7EDF6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 15px 24px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            font-weight: 900;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .button-green {
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
        }

        .button-green:hover {
            background: #237a1b;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .button-outline {
            border-color: white;
            color: white;
        }

        .button-outline:hover {
            background: white;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        /* =========================================================
           QUOTE FORM
           ========================================================= */

        .quote-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }

        .quote-card h2 {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .quote-card > p {
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .form-group.full {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        input,
        textarea,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            outline: none;
            background: white;
        }

        input:focus,
        textarea:focus,
        select:focus {
            border-color: var(--blue);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(23, 98, 181, 0.12);
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 100px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .quote-submit {
            width: 100%;
            border: none;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           TRUST BAR
           ========================================================= */

        .trust-bar {
            background: var(--dark-blue);
            color: white;
            padding: 24px 0;
        }

        .trust-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .trust-item strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .trust-item span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #C8D6EA;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           INTRO
           ========================================================= */

        .section {
            padding: 90px 0;
        }

        .section-light {
            background: var(--light-gray);
        }

        .intro-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .section-label {
            color: var(--green);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section p {
            color: #536174;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .image-placeholder {
            min-height: 430px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    rgba(23, 98, 181, 0.2),
                    rgba(44, 150, 34, 0.2)
                ),
                url("images/intro.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(6, 40, 92, 0.15);
        }

        /* =========================================================
           SERVICES
           ========================================================= */

        .section-heading {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto 50px;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .service-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: white;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--green);
        }

        .service-image {
            height: 180px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .service-1 {
            background-image: url("images/gutters.jpg");
        }

        .service-2 {
            background-image: url("images/gutter-guards.jpg");
        }

        .service-3 {
            background-image: url("images/gutter-cleaning.jpg");
        }

        .service-4 {
            background-image: url("images/gutter-repair.jpg");
        }

        .service-content {
            padding: 23px;
        }

        .service-content h3 {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .service-content p {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .learn-more {
            color: var(--green);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           PROJECTS
           ========================================================= */

        .projects {
            background: var(--dark-blue);
            color: white;
        }

        .projects .section-heading h2 {
            color: white;
        }

        .projects .section-heading p {
            color: #CBD8EA;
        }

        .project-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .project {
            height: 280px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .project:nth-child(1) {
            background-image: url("images/project-1.jpg");
        }

        .project:nth-child(2) {
            background-image: url("images/project-2.jpg");
        }

        .project:nth-child(3) {
            background-image: url("images/project-3.jpg");
        }

        .project:nth-child(4) {
            background-image: url("images/project-4.jpg");
        }

        .project:nth-child(5) {
            background-image: url("images/project-5.jpg");
        }

        .project:nth-child(6) {
            background-image: url("images/project-6.jpg");
        }

        .project-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: auto 0 0;
            padding: 25px;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(
                transparent,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)
            );
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        .project-overlay strong {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           EXPECTATIONS
           ========================================================= */

        .expect-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .expect-image {
            min-height: 450px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: url("images/team-project.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;
        }

        .check-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .check-list li {
            display: flex;
            gap: 13px;
            padding: 13px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: #445066;
        }

        .check {
            width: 23px;
            height: 23px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           SERVICE AREA
           ========================================================= */

        .areas {
            background: var(--light-gray);
        }

        .area-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 35px auto 0;
        }

        .area {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .area:hover {
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
            border-color: var(--green);
        }

        /* =========================================================
           REVIEWS
           ========================================================= */

        .reviews {
            background: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .reviews .section-heading h2 {
            color: white;
        }

        .reviews .section-heading p {
            color: #C9D6E8;
        }

        .stars {
            color: #FFD84D;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .reviews-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .review {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 28px;
        }

        .review p {
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .review-name {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FINAL CTA
           ========================================================= */

        .cta {
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    rgba(23, 98, 181, 0.94),
                    rgba(6, 40, 92, 0.94)
                ),
                url("images/cta.jpg") center/cover;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta h2 {
            color: white;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
        }

        .cta p {
            color: #E1EAF5;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FOOTER
           ========================================================= */

        footer {
            background: #031B40;
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 0 25px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        footer h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        footer p,
        footer a {
            color: #B7C6DA;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .copyright {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            padding-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #8EA1BB;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           FLOATING QUOTE BUTTON
           ========================================================= */

        .floating-quote {
            position: fixed;
            right: 22px;
            bottom: 22px;
            z-index: 999;
            background: var(--green);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .floating-quote:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #237A1B;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           MOBILE
           ========================================================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            nav {
                display: none;
            }

            .mobile-menu {
                display: block;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 80px 0;
            }

            .hero-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 45px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 46px;
            }

            .services-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .intro-grid,
            .expect-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .project-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .reviews-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .navbar {
                min-height: 68px;
            }

            .logo-mark {
                width: 43px;
                height: 43px;
            }

            .logo-text strong {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 60px 0;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .hero-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .button {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .quote-card {
                padding: 22px;
            }

            .form-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .form-group.full {
                grid-column: auto;
            }

            .trust-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 65px 0;
            }

            .services-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .project-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .project {
                height: 250px;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
            }

            .floating-quote {
                left: 15px;
                right: 15px;
                bottom: 15px;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- =========================================================
         HEADER
         ========================================================= -->

    <header>
        <div class="container navbar">

            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <div class="logo-mark">JT</div>

                <div class="logo-text">
                    <strong>JUST THE GUY</strong>
                    <span>GUTTERS & EXTERIORS</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <nav>
                <a href="#services">Services</a>
                <a href="#projects">Our Work</a>
                <a href="#areas">Service Areas</a>
                <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>

                <a href="#quote" class="nav-button">
                    Get A Free Quote
                </a>
            </nav>

            <button class="mobile-menu" aria-label="Open menu">
                ☰
            </button>

        </div>
    </header>


    <!-- =========================================================
         HERO
         ========================================================= -->

    <main>

        <section class="hero">

            <div class="container hero-content">

                <div class="hero-text">

                    <span class="eyebrow">
                        Family Owned • Mid-Michigan
                    </span>

                    <h1>
                        Gutters Built to Protect Your Home.
                    </h1>

                    <p>
                        Seamless gutters, gutter guards, repairs and
                        exterior services designed to keep your home
                        protected from Michigan weather.
                    </p>

                    <div class="hero-buttons">

                        <a href="#quote" class="button button-green">
                            Get A Free Estimate
                        </a>

                        <a href="tel:5170000000" class="button button-outline">
                            Call Us Today
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- QUOTE FORM -->

                <div class="quote-card" id="quote">

                    <h2>Get A Free Quote</h2>

                    <p>
                        Tell us a little about your project and we'll
                        get back to you.
                    </p>

                    <form>

                        <div class="form-grid">

                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="first-name">
                                    First Name
                                </label>

                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    id="first-name"
                                    name="first-name"
                                    required
                                >
                            </div>


                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="last-name">
                                    Last Name
                                </label>

                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    id="last-name"
                                    name="last-name"
                                    required
                                >
                            </div>


                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="email">
                                    Email
                                </label>

                                <input
                                    type="email"
                                    id="email"
                                    name="email"
                                    required
                                >
                            </div>


                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="phone">
                                    Phone
                                </label>

                                <input
                                    type="tel"
                                    id="phone"
                                    name="phone"
                                    required
                                >
                            </div>


                            <div class="form-group full">
                                <label for="service">
                                    What do you need?
                                </label>

                                <select id="service" name="service">

                                    <option>
                                        Select a service
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Gutter Installation
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Gutter Guards
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Gutter Repair
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Gutter Cleaning
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Roofing
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Siding
                                    </option>

                                    <option>
                                        Other
                                    </option>

                                </select>
                            </div>


                            <div class="form-group full">
                                <label for="message">
                                    Tell us about your project
                                </label>

                                <textarea
                                    id="message"
                                    name="message"
                                    placeholder="What are you looking to have done?"
                                ></textarea>
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <button
                            type="submit"
                            class="button button-green quote-submit"
                        >
                            Request My Free Estimate
                        </button>

                    </form>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =====================================================
             TRUST BAR
             ===================================================== -->

        <section class="trust-bar">

            <div class="container trust-grid">

                <div class="trust-item">
                    <strong>Family Owned</strong>
                    <span>Local Mid-Michigan company</span>
                </div>

                <div class="trust-item">
                    <strong>Free Estimates</strong>
                    <span>No pressure, no obligation</span>
                </div>

                <div class="trust-item">
                    <strong>Quality Exterior Work</strong>
                    <span>Built to protect your home</span>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =====================================================
             INTRO
             ===================================================== -->

        <section class="section">

            <div class="container intro-grid">

                <div>

                    <div class="section-label">
                        Just The Guy Gutters & Exteriors
                    </div>

                    <h2>
                        Reliable Gutter Systems Built for Michigan Homes
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        Your gutters do more than move water away from
                        your roof. A properly installed gutter system
                        helps protect your siding, foundation, landscaping
                        and home from water damage.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        We provide gutter installation, gutter guards,
                        gutter repairs and other exterior services for
                        homeowners throughout Mid-Michigan.
                    </p>

                    <a href="#services" class="button button-green">
                        Explore Our Services
                    </a>

                </div>

                <div class="image-placeholder"></div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =====================================================
             SERVICES
             ===================================================== -->

        <section class="section section-light" id="services">

            <div class="container">

                <div class="section-heading">

                    <div class="section-label">
                        What We Do
                    </div>

                    <h2>
                        Exterior Services You Can Count On
                    </h2>

                    <p>
